## Actual Output on Blackwell
```
Mismatch at 8127: GPU='[' (0x5B), CPU='{' (0x7B)
Mismatch at 8128: GPU='[' (0x5B), CPU='{' (0x7B)
...
Mismatch at 8148: GPU='[' (0x5B), CPU='{' (0x7B)
Total mismatches: 22
